markdown-it — vendored third-party dependency
=============================================

File:    markdown-it.js
Package: markdown-it@15.0.2 (https://github.com/markdown-it/markdown-it)
License: MIT (reproduced below)

Why it is checked in
--------------------
The console is served straight out of the daemon jar and must work with no network access and no
build step, so the package's pre-bundled browser ES module is committed rather than loaded from a
CDN. The bundle includes all runtime dependencies and imports nothing remotely.

Regenerating
------------
Download https://registry.npmjs.org/markdown-it/-/markdown-it-15.0.2.tgz and extract
package/dist/browser/markdown-it.esm.min.mjs as markdown-it.js.


